[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6629.35, "timestamp": "01:50:29", "text": "你总是至少要有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6632.79, "timestamp": "01:50:32", "text": "艺术家和游戏制作人，也就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6636.629, "timestamp": "01:50:36", "text": "程序员。这总是如此，每次都是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6643.109, "timestamp": "01:50:43", "text": "嘿，如果我的代码写得不好，我就不会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6645.43, "timestamp": "01:50:45", "text": "用棕榈树。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6647.51, "timestamp": "01:50:47", "text": "为什么奶奶要用？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6650.47, "timestamp": "01:50:50", "text": "我的意思是，在盒子上，其实不是，但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6652.31, "timestamp": "01:50:52", "text": "如果你想用某个特定的婊子，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6654.79, "timestamp": "01:50:54", "text": "我会的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6657.59, "timestamp": "01:50:57", "text": "那么如果我以后买了一款游戏，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6659.59, "timestamp": "01:50:59", "text": "我们就需要寻求帮助"}]